  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Support 64-bit tree_size in CT log list: Google's v3 log list now contains readonly final_tree_head.tree_size values above Int32.MaxValue (e.g. Argon2026h2), which previously caused the log list to fail to load and verification to return LogServersFailed for every host\n- Updated to net10.0\n- Removed BouncyCastle dependency\n- Added User-Agent for Chrome log list requests (Android-only temporary workaround)\n- Added note in README on the issues with using the Chrome CT log list\n- Added note in README to avoid use of this library on Android 16+ (API 36)",
